---
description: Contributing to MonteFiskal (Montenegro EFI fiscalization): evidence rule, parity rule, secrets
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root for layout and commands.

- Evidence rule: fiscal behaviour only where `docs/analysis/business-rules.md` has a rule; quote the rule ID
  (`BR-…`) in the code comment and the test name. Missing or UNVERIFIED rule: say so, do not guess, and never
  use Croatian, Serbian or Albanian rules.
- Parity rule: .NET and PHP change together, with a shared vector in `test-vectors/`.
- Money is decimal, never floating point. No production endpoint in tests, samples or CI.
- Never add certificates, keys, passwords or real taxpayer data. Do not edit `schemas/**/official/`.
